{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>You shall not go with them.</b> He said to Him: If so, I will curse them in my place. He said to him: <b>You shall not curse the people.</b> He said to Him: If so, I will bless them. He said to him: They have no need for your blessing — <b>for they are blessed.</b> A parable: one says to a wasp — neither from your honey nor from your sting (there)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:12:10.240718356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}